      "licenseUrl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0",
      "artist": "Kurt Nordstrom from Montgomery County, MD, USA",
      "description": "This is a photo from the trip to the state fair my wife and I took yesterday with my parents.  Sort of a late-birthday-party thing for me.  I sure can't complain about getting all the fair-food I want, gratis.\nThis is \"Big Tex\", the semi-animatronic giant that you see upon entering the fair.  He talks frequently, and his jaw moves, though not exactly in time with the voice.  He also can turn his head, and his right hand \"waves\", though it only rotates at the wrist, making for some extremely painful looking joint bending.\n\nTex hopes y'all are havin' a good time at the fair, and hopes you'll drop some more of your hard earned money on goods at the fair, so you can support the local economy like good Texans.",
